  "releaseNotes": "v2.3.0 - GetUserMedia failures now throw MediaDeviceException (Name: NotFoundError / NotReadableError / the browser error name; Kind; InnerException) on desktop AND browser. Desktop used to return a stub \"No Camera Found\" / \"No Audio Input Found\" track. DeviceId is exact on both platforms. Desktop video falls through Media Foundation, DirectShow and the next device; a half-built track is released. SpawnJS 2.1.18, ILGPU 5.2.16.",
